    "Supplemental terms" are terms that supplement the terms of this
License by attempting to bless under some circumstances the
protection of the recipients of the covered work, to alleviate
one or more existing problems with the License, as well as to
make sure the License remains free.

    A covered work is a work under this License, regardless of being
integrated with a network server.  This License is concerned with
the possibility that the work being used is accessed over a
network, even if it is hosted on a server itself.  The term "user
interface" is defined in section 2 of this License as: a user
interface is either a reviewable interface or a manipulative interface
where the manipulation of the interface is controlled by user
instructions, and the reviewable interface that was received or
provided, or that was in the form that was intended to be received,
is validated.

